e%3APhareDeLaVieille_DSC08079_PtrQs.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Grocery_store_in_Roma.jpg/500px-Grocery_store_in_Roma.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Grocery_store_in_Roma.jpg/1280px-Grocery_store_in_Roma.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Grocery_store_in_Roma.jpg/500px-Grocery_store_in_Roma.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"These cheeses are private goods. They are rivalrous, as the same piece of cheese can only be consumed once. They are also excludable, as it is possible for the store to prevent someone, such as a non-customer who will not pay the price, from consuming the cheese, as it is privately owned.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGrocery_store_in_Roma.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Vissersboot_op_de_Waddenzee_2021_4.jpg/500px-Vissersboot_op_de_Waddenzee_2021_4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Vissersboot_op_de_Waddenzee_2021_4.jpg/1280px-Vissersboot_op_de_Waddenzee_2021_4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Vissersboot_op_de_Waddenzee_2021_4.jpg/500px-Vissersboot_op_de_Waddenzee_2021_4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Fish stocks in a fishing ground are considered common-pool resources.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AVissersboot_op_de_Waddenzee_2021_4.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/M4_Tolls_for_second_Severn_crossing_-_geograph.org.uk_-_573113.jpg/500px-M4_Tolls_for_second_Severn_crossing_-_geograph.org.uk_-_573113.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/M4_Tolls_for_second_Severn_crossing_-_geograph.org.uk_-_573113.jpg/500px-M4_Tolls_for_second_Severn_crossing_-_geograph.org.uk_-_573113.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A noncongested toll road is an example of a club good. It is possible to exclude someone from using it by simply denying them access but it is not a rival good since one person's use of the road does not reduce its usefulness to others.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AM4_Tolls_for_second_Severn_crossing_-_geograph.org.uk_-_573113.jpg"}],"sounds":{"the goods":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/En-uk-good.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/69/En-uk-good.ogg/En-uk-good.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/28/En-us-good.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/28/En-us-good.ogg/En-us-good.ogg.mp3"}]}}}